#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# multinomial

#% text
# `multinomial(n1, n2, ...)` gives the multinomial coefficient (n1 + n2 + ...)!/(n1! n2! ...).

#% section
# Details

#% item
# Non-negative integers give integers; other numbers use the gamma function.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
multinomial(1, 2, 3)
#% output
#= 60

#% cell
multinomial(2, 2)
#% output
#= 6

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `binomial`, `factorial`
